# Coach Jeff's Job Finder — environment variables
#
# Copy to `.env` and fill in real values:   cp .env.example .env
# `netlify dev` loads `.env` automatically. In production these are set in the
# Netlify UI under Site settings → Environment variables.
#
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# NOTHING HERE IS REQUIRED TO RUN THE APP.
# 9 of the 13 job sources need no credentials at all (Greenhouse, Lever, Ashby,
# SmartRecruiters, Workday, Oracle, Phenom, mCloud, The Muse). Greenhouse alone
# covers 96 employer boards, so you can develop productively with an empty file.
#
# Any source whose keys are missing returns HTTP 200 with {ok:false, jobs:[]}
# and simply contributes nothing to the merged search. Status codes will NOT
# tell you a key is misconfigured — check with:
#     curl 'http://localhost:8888/.netlify/functions/<name>?diag=1'
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------


# --- Adzuna --------------------------------------------------------- OPTIONAL
# Broad job aggregator. Used by netlify/functions/adzuna.js:78-79.
# Both values are required together; without them Adzuna returns no jobs.
# Register: https://developer.adzuna.com/
ADZUNA_APP_ID=
ADZUNA_APP_KEY=


# --- USAJOBS -------------------------------------------------------- OPTIONAL
# US federal jobs. Used by netlify/functions/usajobs.js:29-30.
# Both are required together. USAJOBS MANDATES a contact email, which is sent
# as the User-Agent header — it is not optional on their side.
# Register: https://developer.usajobs.gov/APIRequest/
USAJOBS_API_KEY=
USAJOBS_EMAIL=


# --- CareerOneStop -------------------------------------------------- OPTIONAL
# US Dept. of Labor / National Labor Exchange. Used by
# netlify/functions/careeronestop.js:58-59. Both required together.
#
# LICENSE OBLIGATION: per the comment at careeronestop.js:20-22, using this
# source requires displaying DOLETA / Minnesota DEED attribution and the
# CareerOneStop logo in the UI. Do not enable it without that attribution.
#
# Register: https://www.careeronestop.org/Developers/WebAPI/registration.aspx
COS_USERID=
COS_TOKEN=


# --- The Muse ------------------------------------------------------- OPTIONAL
# Used by netlify/functions/themuse.js:20.
# This source WORKS WITHOUT A KEY. The key only raises the upstream rate limit
# from 500 to 3600 requests/hour. When absent it is simply omitted from the
# query (themuse.js:150) and the response reports `keyed: false`.
# Register: https://www.themuse.com/developers/api/v2
THEMUSE_API_KEY=
